      "text": "to indo moots/non-moots, my heart goes out to you during these painful times. i can only imagine how hard it must be to watch those in power fail the people they should be serving. please stay safe and know you’re in my thoughts and prayers.\n\nand to my own country, the philippines, wherein we are also facing  the effects of corruption in flood projects all while constant rains and flooding remind us of how much ordinary citizens suffer from failed leadership. \n\nit’s heavy, but to everyone who may be seeing this: please know that your voice matters, i hope we can all hold on to strength and continue raising our voices for a better future. we deserve leaders who truly care :(",
