      "text": "🚦Attention all traffic warriors! Ready to see billboard stars while stuck in rush hour? Amigas' are kicking of our Minamahal Project with a static billboard that's about to become your new favorite sight on the way to work! 🌟\n\nGet ready to gaze up and say, \"Is that Minamahal I see?\" as you cross the Pasig River via C5 Road! A month long display of our billboard is taking over the C5 Road, and trust us—it's way more exciting than staring at brake lights! 🙌✨ So while you're stuck in traffic, why not feast your eyes on the official poster of Minamahal?\n\n📍 Location: Lot 3, Blk. 10 Napindan Riverside, West Rembo, Makati City. It’s the perfect pit stop for both drivers and pedestrians!\n\nGet ready to be \"that person\" who points out the billboard to your friends while they’re busy scrolling through their phones. Let's make it big Keepers!\n\n#AshDres #AshDresVille | #AshtineOlviga #AndresMuhlach",
